{"title": "Skilled", "pageid": 8376, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Skilled", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skilled.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Skilled.webp/300px-Skilled.webp, /w/images/8/88/Skilled.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Skilled.webp/300px-Skilled.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Skilled.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Skilled</b> is a passive feature obtainable by a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. You gain Proficiency in 3 Skills of your choice.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> of your choice. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Skilled_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skilled (Feat)\">Skilled (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200512\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 457/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1421/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 741/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/